    "text": "rhsnews.co\nwebsite\nNew Jersey\n264 Fugitives Arrested In Major Tri-state Manhunt Led By US Marshals\nBy Paige Wuthrich,\n20 hours agoDuring a month-long operation targeting gang members, sex offenders, and homicide suspects, the US Marshals New York/New Jersey Regional Fugitive Task Force apprehended 264 fugitives in New Jersey’s most violent communities. The campaign, dubbed Operation Apex Hammer, launched in early June and focused on Camden, Newark, and the neighboring areas, resulting in one of the greatest fugitive roundups in the region this year.",
